{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05592","headline":"自乐城赴永嘉枉路泛白湖寄松阳李少府 · 张子容","name":"自乐城赴永嘉枉路泛白湖寄松阳李少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西行碍浅石，北转入谿桥。\n树色烟轻重，湖光风动摇。\n百花乱飞雪，万岭叠青霄。\n猿挂临潭筱，鸥迎出浦桡。\n惟应赏心客，兹路不言遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}